@kota-yata in my understanding, SSAI should be implemented by an "intermediary" (see #1107), i.e. an entity that is both a Publisher and a Subscriber, but is not a Relay. 

What I have in mind is something as follow (which mixes both your approaches): When it is time for ads, the Original Publisher adds a marker in the "timeline" track. The Intermediary has subscribed to the "regular video" track and the "timeline" track. When it detects the marker in the timeline track, the Intermediary subscribes to the "MoQ compliant ad decisioning system" with the Subscriber track Id=1234. It gets the "Ad timeline" track. Then it subscribes to the Ad track #1 and subsequently Ad track #2. And finally, the intermediary publishes the Objects of both Ad tracks into the "regular video" track toward the end-subscriber.

