Possible delta encoding scheme

```
DeltaLocation {
  Group Delta (i), 
  Object Delta (i) 
}

DeltaRange {
  Start (DeltaLocation),
  End (DeltaLocation)
}

...
  Num Ranges (i),
  [ Requested Range (DeltaRange) ]+
